Recommends: python3-secretstorage, python3-paramiko, openssh-client, udisks2, network-manager
Description: NexusOS shared management backend
 The single implementation of NexusOS management operations used by the
 nexus CLI, the Nexus Command Center and the NexusOS management agent:
 APT/dpkg queries and plans, systemd services, settings, SSH profiles and
 Secret Service credentials, Docker Engine and Compose, the Nexus application
 registry, the NGINX gateway model, storage, NetworkManager, Ollama and the
 notification/activity store.
 .
 Also ships /usr/lib/nexusos/nexus-askpass, which answers OpenSSH password
 prompts from the Secret Service and refuses every other prompt.
